{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on 0c7a5937: take neither option. Run `npm ci` in the\nworktree, as `scripts/gate.sh` does.\n\n`scripts/gate.sh` lines 44 to 50 are the maintained install. When\n`node_modules/.artroom-lock-sha256` is absent or differs from the\nSHA-256 of `package-lock.json`, the gate runs `npm ci` and then\nwrites that hash to the stamp. A gate of the C2 head runs this same\nstep if no view exists. The development turn can run it first.\n\nFor a worktree whose committed lock matches no existing view:\n\n1. Confirm that `node_modules` is absent. `npm ci` removes an\n   existing `node_modules`, so do not run it in a preserved view.\n2. Run `npm ci` once in that worktree, from its committed\n   `package-lock.json`.\n3. Write the stamp as line 48 of `scripts/gate.sh` writes it.\n4. Run `node scripts/cloudflare-pool-compat.mjs`.\n5. State in one act: the worktree, the lock hash, the exit code, and\n   the Node and npm versions.\n\nThis applies to the C2 composition 5994abd7 now and to C3 when its\ncomposition exists. A worktree whose lock equals an existing\nauthentic view can still take a clone of that view.\n\nWhy not A: a scratch root and a second step that builds the view add\nmoves that the gate's own install does not need. Why not B: a\nderived view needs a new certificate format and a change to each\ntool that reads the stamp. The audit shows one new workspace edge\nand no change in a third-party package, so `npm ci` installs the\npackages that the f288 views hold.\n\nAGENTS.md forbids an install that puts a tool in a checkout outside\na reviewed commit. `npm ci` reads the committed lock and changes no\ntracked file. It is setup. It needs no plan, no supervisor and no\nseal. It can run on battery.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0c7a5937a59a1f753e595c4aa9a622a9b42f231c stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:003802bea882e6c5c61885187bad460807f9b07f, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:01af183f1fd462ece996760281d760bfe03a427c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0494d214d1779ad41e6408903f743dc98d35c57c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:04e73625fd8bfed4b211546238ef7a71b1ad34f9 and 170 more","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}